2026-11-07T07:09:41.5839430Z 
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5839820Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5840220Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5872170Z 
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5872890Z I will:
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5873110Z 
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5873280Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5873630Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5874040Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5874510Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5874900Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5875220Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5875560Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5875940Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5919640Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5921000Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5960250Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5960660Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5961520Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5961980Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5962310Z 
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5962570Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T07:09:41.5962810Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
